====================================================================================================
Part A. Exact symbolic checks
====================================================================================================
A1. (1 + |eta + N e2|^2)^(q/2) / N^q = 1 + e*( eta2*q ) + e^2*( q*(eta1**2 + eta2**2*q - eta2**2 + 1)/2 ) + O(e^3), e = 1/N
    so J^q(e^{iNy} a) = e^{iNy}(N^q a - i q N^(q-1) d_y a) + O(N^(q-2)) (eta2 <-> -i d_y), as in (4)
A2. Re of the N^(2q) coefficient minus [(V.Da) a - a^2 + q (d_y V_y) a^2] = 0
    the N^(2q+1) coefficient is purely imaginary: True
    div V = 2*c ; (V.Da) a + (div V/2) a^2 - div(V a^2)/2 = 0 => int (V.Da) a = -c int a^2
A3. general omega: Re N^(2q) coefficient - [(V.Da) a - a^2 + q (omega^T DV omega) a^2] = 0
    weighted: W (V.Da) a - (-c W - V.DW/2) a^2 - div(W V a^2)/2 = 0 => limit ratio -c - 1 + b + q omega^T Sym DV omega (b = -V.D log w)
    Poisson bracket {W |xi|^(2q), V.xi} - m (2q xi^T DV xi/|xi|^2 - V.D log W) = 0
    anisotropic q = 2 symbol mu1 xi1^4 + mu2 xi1^2 xi2^2 + mu3 xi2^4, DV(0) = diag(d1, d2), at xi = e2: bracket/m = 4*d2 (= 2q d_y V_y, weights irrelevant at V(0) = 0)
A4. U symbol at e2: (0, 0) ; |U1| <= |xi1|/|xi| (since |xi2| <= |xi|), |U2| = xi1^2/|xi|^2; on |eta| <= N/2: |xi| >= N/2, so |U1| <= 2|eta1|/N
A5. g = -4y near 0 (mode sin theta, radial part -4r): Psi = -r^3/2 solves Psi'' + Psi'/r - Psi/r^2 = -4*r ; harmonic remainder A r sin(theta) = A y has zero third derivatives; c[g] = -d_1^2 d_2 psi(0) = 1
    consistent with the contact term -h_y(0)/4 of c[h] (R1-008): the sin(3 th) kernel annihilates the sin(th) mode, and -g_y(0)/4 = 1
A6. c = 4076476460239181/2251799813685248 = 1.8103192102000; 9/5 < c < 37/20: True; 2 - c = 0.189681 > 3/20; c - 1 = 0.810319; rate caps c + 1 - q: q = 2: 0.810319, q = 2 + 2^-10: 0.809343, q = 5/2: 0.310319, q = 3: -0.189681

